guide forever-dungeon-quests/alcaz-prison-alliance
title Alcaz Prison (Alliance)
category Dungeons
folder Alcaz Prison
faction Alliance
levels 48-55
zone Alterac Mountains
keywords Alcaz Prison, Alcaz Island, Dustwallow Marsh, Theramore, Mathias Shaw, Sully McCleary, SI:7, Varian, Mason Connery, Renzik, Lan'dalock, Dalaran, Westfall, Connery's Trunk, Zarla's Journal, Wrex, Ca'zass, Katerina, Questioner, Blazeroar, Strashaz, dungeon
reward item 279825 279826 279829
why Every Alliance quest of Alcaz Prison in one run, lead-ins included.

# Alcaz Prison's Alliance quests in one guide: Archmage Lan'dalock in
# Dalaran, Master Mathias Shaw in Stormwind, Sully McCleary in Theramore, one
# run through the prison, then the hand-ins in Theramore, Westfall, Stormwind
# and Dalaran. Steps already done are passed over, so the guide picks up
# wherever the chain stands.
#
# The chain: Shaw's 95194 Our Man in Theramore (to Sully McCleary) -> 95196
# Watch Yer Back (to the second Sully) -> 95198 The Return of the King? (with
# an SI:7 Disguise Kit) -> 95262 The Secret Prison (handed in inside, at a
# window) -> 95263 Somber News -> 95264 Shaw Needs To Know; and 96381 A Bit
# of Wet Work (Strashaz naga and Tidemistress Ca'zass's head). Archmage
# Lan'dalock's 96772 The Dragon's Journal (Zarla's Journal, from Blazeroar).
# The prisoner Mason Connery's 96335 The Man in the Iron Chains (the Ornate
# Shackle Key from The Questioner) -> 96337 More Valuable Than Gold
# (Connery's Trunk in Westfall) -> Renzik "The Shiv"'s 96377 State Secrets
# (a Document Box).
#
# Left out: nothing of the Alliance's.
#
# Inside: nothing in the data places the bosses, the window or Mason Connery
# inside, so their goals stand at the door (@75.4,14.0, Alcaz Island) with
# `group 5`. The bosses come in the order of the client's dungeon journal
# (Overseer Wrex, Tidemistress Ca'zass, Katerina the Cleaner, The Questioner,
# Blazeroar), not of a recorded run; the journal ties The Secret Prison to
# Blazeroar, so the window's steps sit there. Every quest goal is counted by
# the quest log, so a group that takes them in another order still gets each
# step ticked.
#
# Sources (facts only):
# - Quests, NPCs, items, objects and rewards: Polestar's reference data
#   (data/forever, built from QuestieDB Forever 1.1.4) and Polestar 0.4.1.1's
#   Codex page for the dungeon. The Shackle Key is a quest item there: it
#   drops only while Mason's quest is in the log.
# - Players' recordings, as Polestar holds them (data/codex/journal-quests.json):
#   The Secret Prison handed in inside at a window and Somber News taken
#   there, Mason's two quests taken inside and the trunk in Westfall.
# - The door, and the elite Strashaz naga of level 59 to 61 around it:
#   players' recordings (data/codex/entrances.json) and the data's spawns.
# - The dungeon's size, levels and bosses: the client's group finder and
#   dungeon journal, as Polestar's Codex page holds them (five players, levels
#   48 to 55).
# INGAME: what completes The Return of the King? (no objective in the data;
#   Sully hands you an SI:7 Disguise Kit with it). Where inside do the window
#   and Mason Connery stand? Where does the Document Box for State Secrets
#   come from? The data has no source for it, so its step only applies while
#   the box is in your bags.

step Archmage Lan'dalock
  tip In Dalaran.
  accept 96772

step Master Mathias Shaw
  zone Stormwind City
  tip In Stormwind.
  accept 95194

step Sully McCleary
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip In Theramore.
  turnin 95194
  accept 95196

step Sully McCleary
  tip The second Sully, a little north-west.
  turnin 95196
  accept 95198

step The Return of the King?
  tip Sully hands you an SI:7 Disguise Kit with the quest.
  turnin 95198
  accept 95262
  accept 96381

step To Alcaz Prison
  tip A dungeon for five players of level 48 to 55, on Alcaz Island off north-eastern Dustwallow. Elite Strashaz naga of level 59 to 61 crowd the island around the door.
  enter "Alcaz Prison" @75.4,14.0

step Naga
  along until leave
  kill 255995 x15 quest 96381.1 @75.4,14.0 group 5
  kill 255373 x8 quest 96381.2 @75.4,14.0 group 5

step Tidemistress Ca'zass
  tip Overseer Wrex comes before her in the client's journal. She drops her head for Sully.
  collect 273883 quest 96381.3 @75.4,14.0 group 5

step Mason Connery
  tip A prisoner. Take his quest before The Questioner dies: the key drops only while it is in your log. Katerina the Cleaner, the third boss in the client's journal, comes before The Questioner.
  accept 96335 @75.4,14.0

step The Questioner
  tip The fourth boss in the client's journal. He drops the Ornate Shackle Key.
  collect 274029 quest 96335.1 @75.4,14.0 group 5

step Mason Connery
  turnin 96335 @75.4,14.0
  accept 96337 @75.4,14.0

step Blazeroar
  tip The last boss. He drops Zarla's Journal. The client's journal ties The Secret Prison to him: at a window, you learn the King's fate.
  collect 276890 quest 96772.1 @75.4,14.0 group 5
  turnin 95262 @75.4,14.0
  accept 95263 @75.4,14.0

step Before you leave
  label leave
  tip Whatever is still short for A Bit of Wet Work, finish it before you go.
  kill 255995 x15 quest 96381.1 @75.4,14.0 group 5
  kill 255373 x8 quest 96381.2 @75.4,14.0 group 5

step Sully McCleary
  tip Back in Theramore.
  turnin 96381
  turnin 95263
  accept 95264

